# #5837, the claimless advance and the split hint.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestFreeAdvanceIgnoresOpenWindow
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the free advance runs while a hand-off window is open on its marker
PERTURBS: FreeCommit
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE

--- FIND
    /\ ft[a] > rp[a]
    /\ mInit
    /\ ~hoOpen
    /\ rp[a] >= hoClosedAt - 1
    /\ rp[a] >= seenP[a]
--- REPLACE
    /\ ft[a] > rp[a]
    /\ mInit
\* MUTATION: an open window does not hold the advance.
    /\ rp[a] >= hoClosedAt - 1
    /\ rp[a] >= seenP[a]
--- END
